    {
      "text": "he placed at the east of the garden of Eden Cherubims, Gen. 3:24 (Alma 12:21; Moses 4:31). place whereon thou standest is holy, Ex. 3:5 (Acts 7:33). it be eaten in the holy place; in the court of the tabernacle, Lev. 6:16 (16:23). Every place … your feet shall tread shall be yours, Deut. 11:24 (Josh. 1:3). place whereon thou standest is holy, Josh. 5:15. prayer came up to his holy dwelling place, 2 Chr. 30:27. who shall stand in his holy place, Ps. 24:3. dark places of the earth are full of the habitations of cruelty, Ps. 74:20. answered thee in the secret place of thunder, Ps. 81:7. thou hast been our dwelling place, Ps. 90:1. his children shall have a place of refuge, Prov. 14:26. eyes of the Lord are in every place, Prov. 15:3. earth shall remove out of her place, Isa. 13:13 (2 Ne. 23:13). where is the place of my rest, Isa. 66:1 (Acts 7:49). they shall pollute my secret place, Ezek. 7:22. no place was found for them, Dan. 2:35. treadeth upon the high places of the earth, Amos 4:13. Lord cometh forth out of his place, Micah 1:3. in every place incense shall be offered unto my name, Mal. 1:11.",
