    {
      "text": "they cannot have place in the kingdom of my Father, D&C 18:25. in all places, he shall open his mouth and declare my gospel, D&C 24:12. there is a place prepared for them … which place is hell, D&C 29:38. my disciples shall stand in holy places, D&C 45:32 (101:22). Satan shall be bound, that he shall have no place, D&C 45:55. the land of promise, and the place for the city of Zion, D&C 57:2. war will be poured out upon all nations, beginning at this place, D&C 87:2. she shall not be removed out of her place, D&C 90:37 (97:19). lest that wicked one … remove you out of your place, D&C 93:49. a place of thanksgiving for all saints, and for a place of instruction, D&C 97:13. thy house, a place of thy holiness, D&C 109:13. Adam-ondi-Ahman … the place where Adam shall come, D&C 116. where is the pavilion that covereth thy hiding place, D&C 121:1. for your oracles in your most holy places, D&C 124:39. place where God resides is a great Urim and Thummim, D&C 130:8.",
